      deck: '40 cards. 8s, 9s, 10s removed. Rank (Non-trump): K, Q, J, 7-2, A (in black suits) or 2-4, K, Q, J, A (in red suits).',
      equipment: '40 cards. 8s, 9s, 10s removed. Rank (Non-trump): K, Q, J, 7-2, A (in black suits) or 2-4, K, Q, J, A (in red suits).',
